From 886a340cce08c995349d6facb5589869688523ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Voice Bot <voicebot@local>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:16:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] production-integrity: re-baseline 20 frozen sha256 values
 to the current, intended bytes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

test-production-integrity.cjs hashes the 311 files in frozen-production-inputs.json. The list was frozen at the
build05 baseline 3ff5b73 and never re-baselined, so every intended asset change since then (re-encodes, loop-seam
fixes, level fixes, art, lossless meshCompress metas) failed it. With 7c1047b (report every mismatch) it lists
20 of 311 at f3d3614/7c1047b; before that only the first (bgm_main.mp3, changed by 3e0bdc3) was visible, and the
bisect's first failing commit 4c30cf7 had failed on env_skycity.glb. After this commit: 0 of 311, PASS.

Approved by Grok Bot: the current bytes at f3d3614 become the new baseline. Only sha256 values change; list
membership, order, authority and characterControllerSectionSHA256 are untouched. Each new value was recomputed at
f3d3614 (identical bytes at 7c1047b) and equals the blob written by the last commit below (all changes in 3ff5b73..f3d3614 listed, last one wins).

File -> commit that introduced the current bytes (earlier changes in brackets):
- bundles/audio_bgm_island/audio/bgm_main.mp3 -> 3e0bdc3 (GGbot: v3.2 size: bgm 48 -> 40 kbps CBR (main, meadow, skycity), -228,233 B)
- bundles/board_art/popup/chest_closed.png -> d6a0019 (Cursor Agent: Result screen SPEC v2.2: solid 3/4 chest, text cut to 过关啦 / score / 下一关 / 回小岛) [also b0020ed]
- bundles/region_island/character/chr_b_r5g2_lod0_anim_pass2_INTERIM_s1_grokbot2.glb -> 7ecd289 (Grok Bot: Oi 65bdd4c character+stool: BODY09 v44-cold5 static deltas inverse-skinned onto current rig (14 clip)
- bundles/region_island/character/chr_b_r5g2_lod0_anim_pass2_INTERIM_s1_grokbot2.glb.meta -> 260c3d5 (GGbot: Character GLB: enable lossless meshCompress 'compress' only (no quantize/encode) for the package budget)
- bundles/region_island/character_support/reading_chair.glb -> 7ecd289 (Grok Bot: Oi 65bdd4c character+stool: BODY09 v44-cold5 static deltas inverse-skinned onto current rig (14 clip)
- bundles/region_meadow/audio/bgm_meadow.mp3 -> 379e137 (Voice Bot: meadow bgm: smooth the in-game loop seam (150 ms xfade model 4.3 -> 1.7 dB)) [also 3e0bdc3]
